---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — The Computational Democracy Project" description="The mission, story, and team behind Polis.">

<main>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="bg-white px-6 pb-16 pt-24 md:pt-32">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
		<p class="mb-4 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-polis-500">About us</p>
		<h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-slate-900 md:text-5xl">
			We build the infrastructure for collective intelligence.
		</h1>
		<p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
			The Computational Democracy Project is a nonprofit that develops Polis — open-source technology that helps groups of any size find common ground.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- Mission -->
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-6 py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
		<div>
			<p class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-polis-500">Mission</p>
			<h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Technology should amplify listening, not just speaking.</h2>
			<p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
				Most online platforms optimize for engagement — likes, shares, outrage. Polis optimizes for understanding. We believe that when you give people the right tools, they can find the common ground that already exists among them.
			</p>
			<p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
				Our mission is to build the open-source infrastructure that makes large-scale deliberation possible — for governments drafting policy, communities resolving disputes, and organizations making decisions that reflect what their people actually think.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8">
			<div class="space-y-6 text-center">
				<div>
					<p class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-polis-500">2012</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Founded</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<p class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-polis-500">501(c)(3)</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Nonprofit status</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<p class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-polis-500">100%</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Open source, always</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- Origin Story -->
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
		<p class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-polis-500">Origin story</p>
		<h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">From Occupy to algorithms</h2>
		<div class="prose space-y-5 text-slate-600">
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				In 2011, the Occupy movement and the Arab Spring showed the world that millions of people wanted to participate in shaping their societies. But the tools available — social media, town halls, online forums — rewarded the loudest voices, not the best ideas.
			</p>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				The founders of Polis — Colin Megill, Christopher Small, and Michael Bjorkegren — asked a different question: <strong class="text-slate-800">what if technology could help groups find what they agree on, instead of amplifying what divides them?</strong>
			</p>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				The answer was Polis: a system where participants write short statements and vote on each other's ideas. Under the hood, machine learning clusters people into opinion groups and surfaces the points of consensus — the ideas that bridge every divide.
			</p>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				Since then, Polis has been deployed in 50+ countries, used by national governments to shape legislation, and helped millions of people discover what they actually agree on.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- How We're Funded -->
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-6 py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
		<p class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-polis-500">Funding</p>
		<h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">How we're funded</h2>
		<p class="mb-10 text-slate-600">
			The Computational Democracy Project is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit. We're funded by grants from major technology foundations and individual donations. Every dollar goes to code, research, and public deployment.
		</p>
		<div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
				<div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-polis-50 text-polis-500 mx-auto">
					<svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg>
				</div>
				<h4 class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Foundation grants</h4>
				<p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Major technology and democracy foundations</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
				<div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-polis-50 text-polis-500 mx-auto">
					<svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/></svg>
				</div>
				<h4 class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Individual donors</h4>
				<p class="text-xs text-slate-500">People who believe in open-source democracy</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
				<div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-polis-50 text-polis-500 mx-auto">
					<svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
				</div>
				<h4 class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Polis Pro revenue</h4>
				<p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Enterprise services sustain the free tier</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- Team -->
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
		<div class="mb-12 text-center">
			<p class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-polis-500">Team</p>
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">The people behind Polis</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
			{[
				{ name: "Colin Megill", role: "Co-founder" },
				{ name: "Christopher Small", role: "Co-founder" },
				{ name: "Michael Bjorkegren", role: "Co-founder" },
			].map(({ name, role }) => (
				<div class="text-center">
					<div class="mx-auto mb-4 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-slate-100"></div>
					<h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">{name}</h4>
					<p class="text-sm text-slate-500">{role}</p>
				</div>
			))}
		</div>
		<p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-400">Team photos and bios — coming soon.</p>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- CTA -->
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-polis-50 px-6 py-16 text-center">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
		<h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Want to work with us?</h2>
		<p class="mb-8 text-slate-600">Whether you're a government, researcher, funder, or open-source contributor — we'd love to hear from you.</p>
		<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
			<a href="/contact" class="rounded-md bg-polis-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white no-underline shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-polis-800">Get in touch</a>
			<a href="/donate" class="rounded-md bg-amber-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 no-underline shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-amber-600">Support our work</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

</main>

</Layout>
